 "外ごはん": "نُزْهَة (The meal eaten at such a gathering.) / مَهَمَّة سَهْلَة (An easy or pleasant task.)  [picnic]",
 "外ご飯": "نُزْهَة (The meal eaten at such a gathering.) / مَهَمَّة سَهْلَة (An easy or pleasant task.)  [picnic]",
 "外す": "نَقَلَ (to take away) / أَزَالَ (to take away) / أَخْرَجَ (to take away) / جَذَبَ (to take away)  [to remove] / قَطْرَة (small quantity of liquid, just large enough to hold its own ) / نُقْطَة (small quantity of liquid, just large enough to hold its own ) / أَسْقَطَ (to let (something) fall; to allow (something) to fall (eithe)  [to drop (e.g. from a team)] / تَرَكَ (To have a consequence or remnant.) / تَرَكَ, غَادَرَ (To depart; to separate from.) / إِجَازَة, عُطْلَة (Permission to be absent; time away from one's work.)  [to leave (e.g. one's seat)] / تَجَنَّبَ (To keep away from; to keep clear of; to stay away from.)  [to avoid (e.g. peak season)]",
 "外つ国": "بَلَد أَجْنَبِيّ (Any country of which one is not a citizen. (This entry is a translation hub.))  [foreign country]"
}
